# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A {{LANGUAGE}} program made with [Raven](https://github.com/oscar-soirey/Raven) {{RAVEN_VERSION}}.

- `main.xml` is the interface. Edit it in **Raven Designer** (open this folder), or by hand:
  save it while the program runs and the window follows, without building again.
- `strings.csv` holds the texts in each language (`@hello.title` in the XML).
- The program loads both from its working folder, binds the action of the button
  (`OnClicked="hello.clicked"`) and finds the label by its name (`Name="status"`).

## Build and run

{{RUN_INSTRUCTIONS}}

The project uses the Raven SDK installed in `{{RAVEN_SDK}}`.
